WEBVTT

00:05:59.313 --> 00:06:03.192
that it would play a central role
in other countries' transitions.

00:06:03.859 --> 00:06:05.069
And it is.

00:06:05.111 --> 00:06:06.946
The European Union, for instance,

00:06:06.946 --> 00:06:10.866
is 98 percent dependent
on China for rare earths.

00:06:12.118 --> 00:06:13.494
Needless to say,

00:06:13.536 --> 00:06:17.915
this puts China in a prime position
to redesign the global balance of power.

00:06:18.707 --> 00:06:22.002
Now, you may argue
that this is a good thing

00:06:22.002 --> 00:06:24.839
because the global balance of power
needs a rehaul anyway.

00:06:24.880 --> 00:06:26.006
And you know what?

00:06:26.048 --> 00:06:27.675
I can totally roll with that.

00:06:28.801 --> 00:06:32.930
But -- and this applies to China,
the United States,